Hmm interesting thought. A good place to starting place to figure this 
out would be the intrincic spoilers. There are a doubtless a few that 
can't be had together (if they're only available by polymorphing into to 
different things, for example). Anyway it would be an interesting 
chalenge to see what the absolute maximum you could have at once is. One 
problem though, is it would probably involve eating certain rings, which 
may or may not be possible in a particular game (depending on their 
material.)

Besides intrincis, I can think of a few other things that show up on 
that list:
* Polymorphed into foo. (this is likely a given anyway, since it's the 
only way to get certain intrincics)
* Turning to stone.
* Turning into slime. (Yes you can have both)
* Swallowed by foo. (I'm pretty sure you can't offer the Amulet in this 
case. Of course if your goal was just to *end the game* with as many 
attributes as possible...)

